<title>USA: National Gas &amp; Electric forms marketing venture.</title>
<headline>National Gas &amp; Electric forms marketing venture.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Gas &amp; Electric LP said on Wednesday it has formed a partnership to market natural gas and energy services in the Great Lakes region.</p>
<p>The partnership with two subsidiaries of Madison Gas &amp; Electric Co will be called National Energy Management LLC, based in Chicago. It will serve more than 1,000 customers per day.</p>
<p>The Madison Gas subsidiaries involved are Great Lakes Energy Corp and American Energy Management. National Gas &amp; Electric is a subsidiary of PanCanadian Petroleum Ltd.</p>
